factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 10 problems
  reel_script says Vihasini 'qualified for the state competition' (மாநில போட்டிக்கு தகுதி பெற்றார்), but the article only says she 'created an achievement' (சாதனை படைத்துள்ளார) in the state-level 80m hurdles event; it does not say she qualified.
  reel_script says Vihasini 'achieved a record' (சாதனை படைத்தார) in the state competition; the article says she 'created a record/achievement' in the state-level event, which is consistent, but the headline and first line conflate 'qualified for state' with the achievement.
  reel_script says the district-level qualification ('இந்த வெற்றியால் மாணவர்கள் மாவட்ட அளவிலான போட்டிக்கு தகுதி பெற்றனர்') was caused by the wins in the chess, silambam, kabaddi and ball competitions, merging two separate facts; the article says the students qualified for the district-level competition in those events, which is fine, but the sentence wrongly mixes 'the win' as the cause of the district qualification in a way not stated.
  reel_script says the students 'won' in chess, silambam, kabaddi and ball competitions, but the article only says they won at circle (வட்ட) level; the slide text says 'வட்ட' and 'மாவட்ட' inconsistently, and the reel_script omits that these were circle-level wins before saying they qualified for district level.
  reel_script says 'நாமகிரிப்பேட்டை மக்கள் பெருமையுடன் பாராட்டினர்' (the public of Namagiripettai praised with pride), which is not in the article; the article names only the sports teacher, teachers, parents, school management committee and PTA office-bearers as the ones who praised the students.
  reel_script omits the parents, school management committee and PTA office-bearers' praise accurately as listed; instead it says 'பள்ளி ஆசிரியர்கள் மாணவர்களை பாராட்டினர்' and 'புகழ்ந்தனர', which is a loose paraphrase of the article's list rather than a faithful statement.
  caption's 'முழு விவரம்' paragraph says the 80m hurdles race is 'மாநில அளவிலான' and gives the girl's achievement correctly, but the caption header 'மாநில போட்டிக்கு தகுதி' repeats the unsupported 'qualified for state' claim.
  slides_spec slide 'பள்ளி வெற்றி' line 'சிங்கிலியன் கோம்பை அரசு உயர்நிலைப்பள்ளி மாணவர்கள் வட்ட' and 'மாவட்ட' are cut mid-phrase and read as ungrammatical/unclear Tamil fragments, and the second line merges circle-level wins with district-level qualification into one sentence.
  slides_spec hl1 'சிங்கிலியன் கோம்பை மாணவி மாநில' and hl2 '80 மீட்டர் தடை ஓட்டத்தில்' are truncated headline fragments that do not form a clear meaning, and the headline combines a qualification claim not supported by the article.
  Missing from reel_script: the girl's name 'விஹாசினி' is present, but the article's fact that the school is an 'அரசு உயர்நிலைப்பள்ளி' is not stated in the reel, and the wider context that students in many competitions have been winning prizes is only partially conveyed.
