factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script states the shop is 'at Nallur Kandampalayam' and the headline says 'Nallur' — acceptable, but the reel_script says the tahsildar is 'பரமத்தி வேலூர் தாசில்தார்' while the article says 'ப.வேலூர் தாசில்தார்'; minor naming difference, not a factual error.
  The reel_script says the shop was 'opened' after police refused permission, but the article says the individuals had requested permission and police refused; it does not clearly say the shop was opened specifically in defiance of the refusal, so 'போலீசார் அனுமதி மறுத்த பின்னரும் கடை திறப்பு' in slides_spec is an overstatement.
  The caption says the shop was opened 'after the police refused permission' and headline says 'விதிகளை மீறி' (violating rules), which the article only implies through complaints and does not state as established fact.
  The caption's date 'நேற்று (நவம்பர் 7, 2026)' is a posting-date-based claim; the article itself gives only 'நேற்று' without a date, so the specific date is not supported by the article (though it may be the posting date, the article does not confirm it).
  The reel_script omits that the Panchayat Union officials reportedly gave permission while complaints were also made to police and revenue officials; it mentions it, but it omits that the tahsildar's statement is that the union officials granted permission, which it includes — no omission there, but the caption's '📞 தொடர்புக்கு: பரமத்தி வேலூர் தாசில்தார்' presents the tahsildar as a contact point, an invented detail not in the article.
