  The reel_script says the event was held 'in the Mariamman temple annadhana hall', which matches the article, but the reel_script omits that the Deepavali distribution was to elderly people who came to receive food (the article says the elderly came to collect meals); this is minor.
  The reel_script sentence 'இதுவரை தினசரி முதியோருக்கு மதிய உணவு வழங்கப்பட்டு வந்தது' is ungrammatical and mixes the daily meal service with the event, and it omits the 5-year duration context attached to the foundation's ongoing work.
  The caption headline contains a typo: 'வழங்கம்' instead of 'வழங்கப்பட்டது' (the phrase is ungrammatical/unclear).
