factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The reel_script and slides say 'Tamil Nadu' lorries are idle, which matches the article, but the reel_script omits that the petition was sent by Rajasekar, state president of the Tamil Nadu Sand Lorry Owners Protection Association, only partially; the association name is accurately stated, so no issue there.
  The caption includes an English line 'Sand lorries idle across Tamil Nadu, owners petition CM | Namakkal news' which is not in the article and is an unrequested English addition to the Tamil caption (not a footer item).
  The reel_script states 'அரசே நேரடியாக நடத்த வேண்டும்' regarding quarries, consistent with the article, but the reel_script says the 1 lakh+ figure applies to 'ஓட்டுநர்கள், தொழிலாளர்கள்' while the article says 'டிரைவர்கள், தொழிலாளர்கள்' — equivalent, so no issue.
  The reel_script says the demand for online direct sand supply was 'நடவடிக்கை கோரப்பட்டுள்ளது', matching the article; however the slides_spec 'என்ன கோரிக்கை?' omits the online sand supply demand, which is an important demand but is only a slide-omission, not a reel_script omission.
  The caption's 'ஆன்லைன் மூலம் பொதுமக்களுக்கு நேரடியாக மணல் வழங்க வேண்டும்' is accurate; no issue there.
